msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-daemon.md:97
msgid "Force the daemon to trust connecting clients."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-daemon.md:99
msgid ""
"<span id=\"opt-force-untrusted\">[`--force-untrusted`](#opt-force-"
"untrusted)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-daemon.md:101
msgid ""
"Force the daemon to not trust connecting clients. The connection is "
"processed by the receiving daemon before forwarding commands."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-daemon.md:104
msgid "<span id=\"opt-process-ops\">[`--process-ops`](#opt-process-ops)</span>"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-daemon.md:106
msgid ""
"Forces the daemon to process received commands itself rather than forwarding "
"the commands straight to the remote store."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-daemon.md:108
msgid ""
"            This is useful for the `mounted-ssh://` store where some actions "
"need to be performed on the remote end but as connected user, and not as the "
"user of the underlying daemon on the remote end.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-daemon.md:110
msgid ""
